sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI / MCP client
  participant S as APIM / Studio
  participant A as Parent API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as JBMQ
  C->>S: Submit job request
  S->>A: Create / retrieve job
  activate A
  A->>D: Commit job + outbox
  D-->>A: Durable commit
  A-->>S: Job ID + state
  deactivate A
  S->>Q: Publish job reference
  Q-->>S: Publication accepted
  S->>A: Record publication
  S-->>C: 202 + job ID + state
  Note over S,D: The outbox relay repairs interrupted publication.
